<title>USA: Indonesia Telkom at 36-1/4 in New York.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Telkom at 36-1/4 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at 36-1/4 in New York on Friday. It recorded the day's low of 35-3/4 and the day's high of 36-1/4.</p>
<p>Volume was 23,700 American Depository Shares. Block volume was nil.</p>
<p>It previous close on Thursday was 35-3/4. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
